r:#6B7280;\">5 lessons · 3 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;\">+</span></div><div style=\"padding:16px 20px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#6B7280;\"><div>📹 Introduction to Digital Marketing</div><div>📹 The Digital Marketing Ecosystem</div><div>📹 Setting Marketing Goals &amp; KPIs</div><div>📄 Customer Journey Mapping</div><div>✅ Module 1 Quiz</div></div></div></div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\"><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 2: SEO Mastery</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">6 lessons · 4 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;\">+</span></div></div><div style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #E5E7EB;\"><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 3: Google Ads &amp; Paid Search</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">5 lessons · 3.5 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;\">+</span></div></div><div><div style=\"padding:18px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;\"><div><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;font-size:15px;\">Module 4: Social Media Strategy</span><span style=\"margin-left:12px;font-size:12px;color:#6B7280;\">6 lessons · 4 hours</span></div><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6B7280;\">+</span></div></div></div></div><div><h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#0F172A;margin:0 0 20px;\">Your Instructor</h2><div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px;border:1.5px solid #E5E7EB;border-radius:16px;\"><img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/team1/100/100\" style=\"width:72px;he